#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu found on the <guilabel>Preferences</"
"guilabel> dialog displays the <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Fonts</guilabel> tabbed forms."
