#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Ed</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"diff can produce commands that direct the ed text editor to change the first "
"file into the second file. Historically, this was the only output mode "
"suitable for automatically editing one file into another. With the advent of "
"<application>patch</application> this option is hardly ever used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The normal output format displays differing lines without any surrounding "
"lines of context."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>RCS</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The RCS output format is designed specifically for use by the Revision "
"Control System (<acronym>RCS</acronym>). Like Ed format, this format is "
"rarely used since the <application>patch</application> program was "
"introduced."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid "Unified"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The unified output format is a variation on the context format. It is "
"considered better than context because the output is more compact than that "
"of context as it omits redundant context lines."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:564
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lines of Context"
